---
// Key statement inside a chapter — same look as the key sentence in the Outcome reflection.
---
<p class="reflection-key"><slot /></p>
<style>
  .reflection-key { margin: var(--space-2) 0; padding-left: var(--space-5, 20px); border-left: 3px solid var(--accent-fill, var(--color-accent-green-fill));
    font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.5rem; line-height: 1.4; letter-spacing: -0.01em; color: var(--color-text-primary); text-wrap: pretty; max-width: 720px; }
  @media (max-width: 743px) { .reflection-key { font-size: 1.25rem; } }
</style>
